  "text": {
    "intro": "The Mesa Verde Ascent is less a race than a slow argument conducted at two thousand feet.\nFive pilots are involved. Determine each pilot's start time, envelope and landing site.\n- **Pilot**: Annika, Grover, Rosa, Rafael and Delia.\n- **Start time** (listed from earlier to later): 8am, 9am, 10am, 11am and noon.\n- **Envelope**: the oxblood envelope, the saffron envelope, the striped envelope, the silver envelope and the kingfisher envelope.\n- **Landed at**: a cabbage field, an RV park, a rail siding, a flooded quarry and a little-league outfield.\nEvery pilot has a different start time, envelope and landing site, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
    "clues": [
      "The pilot who flies the silver envelope and noon are exactly one hour apart in start time order, in one direction or the other.",
      "The pilot who comes down in a flooded quarry and noon are exactly two hours apart in start time order.",
      "Annika and 10am are exactly one hour apart in start time order, in one direction or the other.",
      "The pilot who flies the striped envelope and noon are exactly two hours apart in start time order.",
      "Delia is exactly one hour earlier than the pilot who comes down in a flooded quarry, with no start time in between.",
      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) The pilot who comes down in a cabbage field and Delia are exactly two hours apart in start time order. (b) Grover flies the saffron envelope.",
      "The pilot who flies the saffron envelope and Rafael are exactly one hour apart in start time order, in one direction or the other.",
      "The pilot who flies the striped envelope is earlier than the pilot who comes down in a rail siding in start time order.",
      "Rosa is earlier than the pilot who flies the kingfisher envelope in start time order.",
      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) Grover comes down in a cabbage field. (b) Rafael comes down in a flooded quarry.",
      "The pilot who comes down in an RV park and Grover are exactly three hours apart in start time order."
    ]
  }
